   "url": "https://x.com/DoWCIODavies/status/2112302769071686132",
   "text": "Autonomous Penetration Testing (CAPT), an AI-powered capability that enables internal-network penetration testing at no cost and without prior expertise. \n \nNSA’s CAPT is designed to help",
