   "date": "2026-10-18",
   "url": "https://x.com/DoWCIODavies/status/2111893302895079571",
   "text": "tools used by our adversaries. AI has increased the sophistication of the attacks and the data available to the attackers. Every member of the @DeptofWar",
   "source_type": "x",
