   "url": "https://x.com/DoWCIODavies/status/2103217727204663642",
   "text": "AI is changing the way the @DeptofWar is thinking about upskilling the workforce. At the Billington Cybersecurity Summit, DoW CIO Kirsten Davies shared her thoughts",
   "source_type": "x",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "official_role",
    "speaker": "Kirsten A. Davies",
